🧠 Pattern 6: Frequency / Counting Pattern
Focus: Counting occurrences of elements using HashMap / frequency array.
Used for duplicates, majority element, character counts, and frequency-based logic.
| # | Problem                                                       | Platform   | Skill                      |
| - | ------------------------------------------------------------- | ---------- | -------------------------- |
| 1 | Count frequency of each element                               | GFG / Self | HashMap basics             |
| 2 | Find element appearing more than n/2 times (Majority Element) | LeetCode   | Moore’s Voting / Frequency |
| 3 | Count distinct elements                                       | GFG        | HashSet usage              |
| 4 | Check if two arrays are equal (frequency-based)               | GFG        | Frequency comparison       |
| 5 | Find elements occurring more than k times                     | Self       | Counting + Conditions      |
💡 Practice using both HashMap and array-based frequency (for limited element range).

